# Earth Rumble's fight is part of the reflexive trigger, whose targets must both still be legal as it resolves (CR 701.14b, 608.2b).
# With the trigger on the stack choosing the earthbent Forest (2/2) to fight Bot2's Elvish Mystic, Bot2 kills the Forest with
# Lightning Bolt: neither deals damage, the Mystic is unhurt, and the Forest's delayed trigger returns it as a plain land (three Forests are on the battlefield, none a creature)
# (CR 701.66a, 603.7).

